   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Sam. Your identity is verified.\n\nI checked order 8001 from Burger Barn (bacon cheeseburger and onion rings, $28.03 charged to your Visa ending 4242). Here's what the courier log shows:\n\n- The courier picked up the order at 6:47 PM and arrived at the address at 7:05 PM.\n- They called twice (7:06 and 7:09 PM) and got no answer.\n- At 7:15 PM the delivery was marked failed because the customer could not be reached. The order was returned to the restaurant at 7:28 PM.\n\nThe app showing \"delivered\" doesn't match the courier record. The record shows no handoff, so the order was never delivered to anyone.\n\nBecause the failure happened when the courier couldn't reach you, I can't issue a refund or credit for this order under our policy. If the address on the order was wrong, or if you were unavailable at that time, that is the cause of the failure.\n\nHere's what I can do:\n- If you think the delivery address was entered incorrectly, tell me the correct address. I can't change this order now because it has already been picked up and returned, but I can note it for the team.\n- If you didn't receive the order, I can hand your case to a human specialist to review the record.\n\nHow would you like to proceed?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "So I just lose my $28.03? I was in the shower when they came, and my phone was on silent. I only saw the missed calls later. I'd still like the refund."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand, and I'm sorry. Missing the delivery while in the shower with your phone on silent is frustrating. But I can't refund this order. Our policy doesn't allow a refund or credit when the courier can't reach the customer, and the record shows two call attempts with no answer before the delivery was marked failed.\n\nHere's what I can offer:\n- **A human review:** If you want a specialist to look at this, I can pass your case to them. They'll follow up within 24 hours, but I can't promise the outcome.\n- **A new order:** You're welcome to place a new order from Burger Barn. Just make sure the address and your phone number are correct, and keep your phone on ring so the courier can reach you.\n\nWould you like me to escalate this to a human specialist?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, so I'm not getting the $28.03 back. That's annoying, but I guess I'll take the specialist review. Please pass it along."
